### Get All
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes/timeline/events?page=1&perPage=32&orderBy=timestamp&orderDirection=desc&
    queryFilter=(recipe.slug="homemade-pizza-recipe") AND eventType IN ["info", "system", "comment"]
accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

###### Update (subject required; eventMessage, image optional)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/recipes/timeline/events/{{eventId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{ "subject": "Juan made this", "eventMessage": "Cook a little longer." }

### Upload photo (multipart: extension + image)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/recipes/timeline/events/{{eventId}}/image
Authorization: {{token}}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/recipes/timeline/events/{{eventId}}
Authorization: {{token}}

### Members (author names)
GET {{baseUrl}}/households/members?page=1&perPage=-1
Authorization: {{token}}

###
